Modifications
-------------
  Modified by SkyTekx (the ts4.party community), 2026, for the SkyTekx 3 modpack. This build runs
  on Minecraft 1.20.1 with Forge 47, Cucumber 7.0.16 and Mystical Agriculture 7.0.24, keeps the mod
  id mysticalautomation and is versioned 1.0.8-skytekx.1.

  Summary of the changes:
    * Build: ForgeGradle for Forge 1.20.1 on Java 17, reproducible jar (no file timestamps, fixed
      entry order, no build timestamp in the manifest). This NOTICE and the upstream LICENSE ship
      inside the jar. mods.toml marks the build as a modified, unofficial one, sends bug reports to
      SkyTekx and drops the upstream update URL.

  The complete source of this build, with every change as a separate commit, is in
  https://github.com/skytekx/skytekx3-1201-server under ports/mysticalautomation.
  ports/mysticalautomation/UPSTREAM.md lists every change to the upstream build.

